    },
    {
      "category": "conservation",
      "text": "Main threats: diamond mining, a new port and green hydrogen projects on its dunes.",
      "source": "iucn"
    },
    {
      "category": "conservation",
      "text": "In 2026 its status was raised from Near Threatened to Vulnerable.",
      "source": "iucn"
